### Dynamic Model Selection

The service can automatically select models based on query characteristics:

```python
# Model selection based on query complexity
def select_claude_model(query_complexity: str) -> str:
    models = {
        "simple": "anthropic.claude-3-haiku-20240307-v1:0",
        "standard": "anthropic.claude-3-sonnet-20240229-v1:0",
        "complex": "anthropic.claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022-v2:0"
    }
    return models.get(query_complexity, models["standard"])
```

